    "selection": "Conservative union of (a) true spherical S2 level-4 covering of the entire EPSG:4326 Kenya boundary bounding box (using s2sphere.RegionCoverer with min_level=max_level=4) and (b) all official tile GeoJSON polygons intersecting the full-resolution Kenya boundary. Download all published objects in this union.",
    "coverage_verification": "The mathematical spherical S2 bounding-box cover is a superset of Kenya. Its 11 published tiles (plus one officially unprovided bbox-only candidate 187) are used. Their official tile polygon union covers the entire Kenya ADM0 geometry (covers=True, boundary-minus-union area=0 square degrees). The original 10 directly intersecting tiles already have 0.16438123814696362-degree minimum outer-edge margin; 19b is additionally downloaded conservatively. Candidate 187 is absent from the official manifest and bucket and is disjoint from Kenya. No claim is made that an absent upstream file proves worldwide absence of detections in that cell.",
